\details{
For Gaussian outcomes, \code{\link{m_star}} computes approximate
and exact replication thresholds for a specified tolerance on
the relative difference in full conditional coefficient variances.
\code{\link{variance_comparison}} compares variances at an observed
design, including unequal replication and multiple covariates.

\code{\link{two_stage_estimate}} estimates covariance parameters
using a preliminary nonspatial fit and compares conditional
variances under the two models.

\code{\link{spfit}} fits the models, and
\code{\link{posterior_summary}} summarizes marginal posterior
draws, including means, medians, variances, and credible intervals.
}

